# The grass under the weather (grass.gdshader, slice 4): dry, then rain (tips
# bowed, a fast shiver of hits, blades wet and dark), snow (blades bowed and
# stiff, white lying on the upper blade), and ash (blades greyed), at one place
# and one hour, over the shoulder. Snow and ash lie only where the ground can
# hold them (SkyGround), and on seed 7 no snowfield meets grass, so snow is
# shot on the snowfield's own tufts and ash where the burning meets the sulphur
# jungle's grass; the coast's meadow takes dry and rain. Each weather has a dry
# frame of the same place beside it.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/foliage_weather.tour --seed=7
hour 11
coast calm
place coast
near meadow
hold shoulder_peek
await shoulder 3
weather clear:0:wind=0.5
wait 3.0
shot 01-meadow-dry with land:coast
weather rain:1:wind=0.5
wait 4.0
shot 02-meadow-rain with land:coast
place snowfield
ground snow
weather clear:0:wind=0.5
wait 3.0
shot 03-snowfield-grass-dry with land:snowfield
weather snow:1:wind=0.5
wait 4.0
shot 04-snowfield-grass-snow with land:snowfield
place burning-sulphur_jungle
ground grass
weather clear:0:wind=0.5
wait 3.0
shot 05-burning-grass-dry with land:burning|sulphur_jungle
weather ash:1:wind=0.5
wait 4.0
shot 06-burning-grass-ash with land:burning|sulphur_jungle
release shoulder_peek
weather rules
